    if (i < -1 || (id != null && i < 0)) return { ok: false, reason: "插入位置不存在" };
    const nb = { id: uid(), type, text: "" };
    trial.blocks.splice(i + 1, 0, nb);
    newId = nb.id;
  }, { describe: "已插入段落" });
  return ok ? newId : null;
}
```

Type select conversion of the TITLE? No select for title — only text edit. R1 by construction ✓.

Block count guard: none needed.

